  "slug": "pumpkin-cream-cold-foam-recipe-11803001",
  "name": "This Copycat Pumpkin Cold Foam Tastes \u2018Even Better Than Starbucks,\u2019 According to Our Test Kitchen",
  "recipe_type": "snack",
  "brief_description": "Wondering how to make pumpkin cold foam? Pumpkin Cream Cold Foam is a fall favorite at Starbucks, but it's so easy to make at home!",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Place heavy cream, milk, vanilla syrup, pumpkin puree, and pumpkin pie spice in a small measuring cup or jug. Using a handheld milk frother, froth until thick and creamy, about 1 minute."
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "text": "Pour desired amount of Pumpkin Cream Cold Foam over your iced drink of choice. Dust with additional pumpkin pie spice. Serve immediately. Recipe developed by Nicole Hopper"
    }
  ],
